{{!
    @template block_rajabsgames/status

    The badge status bar the video page shows in its navigation bar and chapter list: each badge with the viewer's claimed and placed counts.

    block_rajabsgames/main (JavaScript) renders it and injects it into the interactive video page;
    the root carries the plugin's scoping class, and the claim handler updates the counts in place.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * badges - array of badges: id, name, picture, classes ('filter' greys the picture), mine (claimed),
      badgecount (placed in this video)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "badges": [
            {
                "id": 1700000001,
                "name": "Explorer",
                "picture": "https://moodle.example/pluginfile.php/27/block_rajabsgames/content/0/explorer.png",
                "classes": "filter",
                "mine": 1,
                "badgecount": 3
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="block-rajabsgames block-rajabsgames-status d-flex align-items-center iv-mr-3">
{{#badges}}
<div class="iv-mr-3 d-flex flex-column align-items-center rg_badgestatus_item" data-id="{{id}}">
    <img class="rg_badge_picture {{classes}}"
        src="{{picture}}"
        alt="{{name}}"
        title="{{name}}"
        width="25"
        height="25">
    <small class="rg_badge_count iv-font-weight-light">
    <span class="badge-count" data-count="{{mine}}" data-total="{{badgecount}}">{{mine}}</span> / {{badgecount}}</small>
</div>
{{/badges}}
</div>
